# Non-negotiable

1. Every color comes from `site/assets/tokens.css`. Writing a raw hex, `rgb()`, or `hsl()`
   anywhere except `tokens.css` is a build failure. If you believe a new color is
   needed, STOP and ask — do not add it.
2. Every padding, margin, and gap uses a `--s-*` token. No raw `px` for spacing.
   No new rungs on the ladder.
3. Every font-size uses a `--t-*` token. No new `clamp()` expressions for type.
4. Exactly three breakpoints: `--bp-sm` 40rem, `--bp-md` 60rem, `--bp-lg` 80rem.
   `min-width` only. Never `max-width` for layout breakpoints.
5. Exactly two radii: `--radius-flat` (0) and `--radius-ctrl` (4px).
6. Motion uses `--dur-fast|base|slow` and `--ease-std|enter` only.
   Every animation must have a `prefers-reduced-motion` counterpart.
7. Zero `!important`. Fix specificity instead.
8. No `box-shadow` for elevation. Depth comes from `--rule` hairlines and the
   paper / paper-raised / paper-sunk surface trio.
9. No gradients. No `backdrop-filter`. No noise, grain, mesh, or grid overlays.
   These were deliberately removed; re-adding any is a regression.
10. All numeric content gets `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums lining-nums`.
11. Accents are semantic only: `--black-ink` (above break-even) and `--red-ink`
    (below). Do not invent a third brand accent (no cyan, brass, terracotta).

# Scope discipline

Change only what the current phase specifies. Do not "improve" copy or add
sections unless the phase asks. Note out-of-scope finds in `docs/TODO.md`.

# When uncertain

Ask. Never invent a design decision to unblock yourself.
